# GitHub Pages la hosting TINH (khong co server/database rieng) nen khong the lam "tai khoan that"
# cho tung nguoi — giai phap kha thi la MA HOA THAT SU toan bo noi dung trang (AES-256-GCM, khoa suy
# ra tu mat khau qua PBKDF2-SHA256) roi boc trong 1 "vo" (shell) HTML nho chi co man hinh dang nhap.
# Thong so PBKDF2/AES-GCM ben duoi PHAI khop tuyet doi voi doan JS (Web Crypto API) trong shell va
# trong chinh dashboard (tinh nang "Doi mat khau") — doi 1 ben ma khong doi ben kia se lam sai lech,
# khong giai ma duoc.
# ================================================================================================
